# The Desk serves SEVERAL candidates from one deployment, so nothing that
# belongs to one candidate may ship as a static file — a static file is served
# to everyone who can sign in. Each candidate's data comes from api/jobs under
# their own blob prefix, and PDFs render on demand from api/pdf.
#
# `apply export` still writes these into site/ (export_desk.py) for the local
# preview; this file keeps them out of the upload.
resume*.pdf
resume_*.pdf
resume.html
base_resume.pdf
# The guided tour embeds an annotated screenshot of ONE candidate's real queue.
# Until bin/build_guide.py can build it from sample data, it does not ship.
guide.html
# Local only.
.env*
tests/
node_modules/
